    "explanation": "After entering the intersection where the circular traffic is organized, marked with the sign 4.3 \"Circular traffic\", you will have an advantage in traffic over a passenger car, since when entering this intersection, its driver is obliged to give way to the vehicle moving along it, clause 13.11.1.(Changes to traffic regulations dated November 8, 2017)",
